<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <title><%= title %></title>
  <style>
    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
      background: #f5f5f5;
      color: #333;
    }

    header {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
      color: white;
      padding: 20px 40px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
    }

    header h1 {
      font-size: 1.8em;
    }

    nav {
      display: flex;
      gap: 20px;
      align-items: center;
    }

    nav a, nav button {
      color: white;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 500;
      transition: opacity 0.2s;
      background: none;
      border: none;
      cursor: pointer;
      font-size: 1em;
    }

    nav a:hover, nav button:hover {
      opacity: 0.8;
    }

    .container {
      max-width: 1200px;
      margin: 40px auto;
      padding: 0 20px;
    }

    .welcome-section {
      background: white;
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 30px;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
      box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
    }

    .welcome-section h2 {
      color: #667eea;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .welcome-section p {
      color: #666;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .user-info {
      background: #f0f4ff;
      padding: 15px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      margin-top: 15px;
      border-left: 4px solid #667eea;
    }

    .quick-links {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
      gap: 20px;
      margin: 30px 0;
    }

    .link-card {
      background: white;
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 30px;
      text-align: center;
      box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
      transition: transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;
    }

    .link-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-5px);
      box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(102, 126, 234, 0.2);
    }

    .link-card a {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 15px;
      padding: 12px 30px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
      color: white;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 6px;
      font-weight: 600;
      transition: transform 0.2s;
    }

    .link-card a:hover {
      transform: scale(1.05);
    }

    .link-card h3 {
      color: #667eea;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .link-card p {
      color: #666;
      font-size: 0.95em;
    }

    @media (max-width: 600px) {
      header {
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 20px;
        padding: 20px;
      }

      header h1 {
        font-size: 1.4em;
      }

      nav {
        width: 100%;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        justify-content: center;
      }

      .container {
        padding: 0 15px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <h1>🎸 Toko Gitar Heber</h1>
    <nav>
      <a href="/dashboard">Dashboard</a>
      <a href="/products">Produk</a>
      <span>Selamat Datang, <%= user.name %>!</span>
      <button onclick="logout()">Logout</button>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <div class="container">
    <div class="welcome-section">
      <h2>Selamat Datang di Dashboard!</h2>
      <p>Anda telah berhasil login ke Toko Gitar Heber. Jelajahi koleksi gitar dan perlengkapan musik kami yang lengkap.</p>
      
      <div class="user-info">
        <strong>Informasi Akun:</strong><br>
        Nama: <%= user.name %><br>
        Email: <%= user.email %>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="quick-links">
      <div class="link-card">
        <h3>🛍️ Lihat Produk</h3>
        <p>Jelajahi koleksi gitar dan perlengkapan musik terbaik kami dengan harga yang kompetitif.</p>
        <a href="/products">Belanja Sekarang</a>
      </div>

      <div class="link-card">
        <h3>📞 Hubungi Kami</h3>
        <p>Jika Anda memiliki pertanyaan atau butuh bantuan, jangan ragu untuk menghubungi tim kami.</p>
        <a href="https://wa.me/+6282230816380" target="_blank">WhatsApp</a>
      </div>

      <div class="link-card">
        <h3>ℹ️ Tentang Toko</h3>
        <p>Pelajari lebih lanjut tentang Toko Gitar Heber dan komitmen kami terhadap kualitas.</p>
        <a href="/">Kembali ke Beranda</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <script>
    function logout() {
      if (confirm('Apakah Anda yakin ingin logout?')) {
        window.location.href = '/logout';
      }
    }
  </script>
</body>
</html>
